Polygon outside/inside arcs lens for LRC -- codex-2026-06-01 S529

MODEL
========================================================================
Simplex view: a tournament has C(m,2) independent-looking binary edges.
Polygon view: a cyclic outside gap necklace determines every hidden
inside chord by consecutive gap sums and the half-turn threshold.
D_n acts on the outside necklace; inside chords split into distance
channels.  LRC marks one outside vertex as the observer/clasp.

